{"title":"ARCHIVE SALE","description":"\u003cp\u003eDon't miss your last chance to own iconic Datum Dahleez pieces at unbeatable prices! Our Archive Sale is your opportunity to snag exclusive items that celebrate the essence of luxury and performance—now at specially reduced prices. Dive in and explore our curated selection of timeless attire, accessories, and collectibles before they're gone for good!\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"wireless-gaming-headphones-in-nocturne-and-jet-orange","title":"WIRELESS GAMING HEADPHONES IN NOCTURNE \u0026 JET ORANGE","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your gaming experience with the Datum Dahleez Wireless Gaming Headphones. Immerse yourself in crystal-clear audio and hear every detail with custom Beryllium drivers and exceptional acoustics with independent volume controls for mic and game so you won't miss a move. The detachable boom microphone and internal mic array provide exceptional talk quality even when the boom mic is detached, allowing for optimal communication in a sophisticated, flexible design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCrafted from premium materials, the lightweight magnesium ear cups paired with cushioned lambskin leather pads, an Alcantara®-lined inner headband for enhanced grip, and a coated canvas outer headband offer unparalleled comfort during play and a wear that only gets better with time. Plus, for longer playtime, on-head detection preserves the battery life of your wireless gaming headphones.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay online for longer and get to 50% battery life in only 30 minutes of charging. Use the low-latency adapter to eliminate audio delays and effortlessly switch between your PC and console with convenient plug and play. An optional USB-C to 3.5mm analog connection for other compatible consoles provides added versatility.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344130777435,"sku":"MG20BGT1","price":650.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/a18_22942621-1bb4-478c-b523-5bcd7fa57f71.jpg?v=1742416362"},{"product_id":"wireless-gaming-headphones-in-blanc-and-deep-blue","title":"WIRELESS GAMING HEADPHONES IN BLANC \u0026 DEEP BLUE","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your gaming experience with the Datum Dahleez Wireless Gaming Headphones. Immerse yourself in crystal-clear audio and hear every detail with custom Beryllium drivers and exceptional acoustics with independent volume controls for mic and game so you won't miss a move. The detachable boom microphone and internal mic array provide exceptional talk quality even when the boom mic is detached, allowing for optimal communication in a sophisticated, flexible design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCrafted from premium materials, the lightweight magnesium ear cups paired with cushioned lambskin leather pads, an Alcantara®-lined inner headband for enhanced grip, and a coated canvas outer headband offer unparalleled comfort during play and a wear that only gets better with time. Plus, for longer playtime, on-head detection preserves the battery life of your wireless gaming headphones.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay online for longer and get to 50% battery life in only 30 minutes of charging. Use the low-latency adapter to eliminate audio delays and effortlessly switch between your PC and console with convenient plug and play. An optional USB-C to 3.5mm analog connection for other compatible consoles provides added versatility.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344131924315,"sku":"MG20BGT3","price":650.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/a14_1_9384fcf7-1faa-4794-98e2-de4e505d173a.jpg?v=1742416360"},{"product_id":"wireless-gaming-headphones-in-nocturne-and-lake-blue","title":"WIRELESS GAMING HEADPHONES IN NOCTURNE \u0026 LAKE BLUE","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your gaming experience with the Datum Dahleez Wireless Gaming Headphones. Immerse yourself in crystal-clear audio and hear every detail with custom Beryllium drivers and exceptional acoustics with independent volume controls for mic and game so you won't miss a move. The detachable boom microphone and internal mic array provide exceptional talk quality even when the boom mic is detached, allowing for optimal communication in a sophisticated, flexible design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCrafted from premium materials, the lightweight magnesium ear cups paired with cushioned lambskin leather pads, an Alcantara®-lined inner headband for enhanced grip, and a coated canvas outer headband offer unparalleled comfort during play and a wear that only gets better with time. Plus, for longer playtime, on-head detection preserves the battery life of your wireless gaming headphones.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay online for longer and get to 50% battery life in only 30 minutes of charging. Use the low-latency adapter to eliminate audio delays and effortlessly switch between your PC and console with convenient plug and play. An optional USB-C to 3.5mm analog connection for other compatible consoles provides added versatility.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344133923163,"sku":"MG20BGT2","price":650.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/a22_1_9a1091e5-ab51-4c21-8de4-8469bbe75f91.jpg?v=1742416359"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-heritage-t-shirt-piquet-white","title":"Datum Dahleez HERITAGE T-SHIRT PIQUET WHITE","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThis simple white short sleeved t-shirt boasts understated luxury, with a subtle EB logo on the front and sleeve details. Made from 95% cotton, 5% elastane.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"XS","offer_id":4934